#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:12
msgid "PRINCE2 — Project Management for AI Agents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:14
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:16
msgid ""
"PRINCE2 (PRojects IN Controlled Environments) is a process-driven, "
"product-focused project management framework. This skill maps its 7 "
"principles, 7 themes, and 7 processes to AI coding agent workflows for "
"structured, high-quality delivery."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:18
msgid ""
"**This skill is MANDATORY for all delegated work and multi-step "
"projects.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:22
msgid "The 7 Principles (Mandatory Foundations)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:24
msgid "PRINCE2 7th Edition (2023) Key Updates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:25
msgid ""
"**Outputs → Outcomes**: Focus shifted from product delivery to value "
"delivery. Always ask \"why\" before \"what\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:26
msgid ""
"**Sustainability mandate**: Every project must address environmental, "
"social, and economic impacts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:27
msgid ""
"**Human-centric focus**: Team psychology, emotional intelligence, and "
"remote/hybrid dynamics are now core concerns."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:28
msgid ""
"**Elevated tailoring**: Framework is significantly less prescriptive — "
"strip unnecessary controls for digital/Agile environments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:30
msgid ""
"Note: The \"Organization\" theme has been replaced by \"**People**\" (see"
" themes below). The 7 principles remain structurally the same but with "
"updated guidance emphasizing outcomes over outputs and value over "
"products."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:32
msgid "No project proceeds unless ALL 7 principles are satisfied:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "#"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "Principle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "AI Agent Implementation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "**Continued Business Justification**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Before starting, validate: acceptance criteria are clear, success metrics"
" defined, ROI viable. Halt if scope drifts from value. Revalidate at each"
" stage gate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "**Learn from Experience**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Consult knowledge base (brain files, session history, past PRs) before "
"coding. Append new learnings after completion. Maintain failure pattern "
"library."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "**Defined Roles & Responsibilities**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Operate within permission scopes. Clear escalation: agent "
"implements/reviews → human approves/merges. Never self-approve production"
" changes. Maintain RACI matrix."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "**Manage by Stages**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Work partitioned into phases (Design → Implement → Test → Deploy). Each "
"stage has entry/exit criteria and a gate check. Timeboxed or deliverable-"
"linked stages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "**Manage by Exception**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Define tolerances per stage (time, complexity, test coverage, security "
"score). See Exception Tolerance Table below. Breaches = automatic pause +"
" escalation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "**Focus on Products**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Start with Product Breakdown Structure (PBS). Derive tasks from tangible "
"deliverables (APIs, modules, tests, docs), not activity lists. Activity "
"alone is never \"done\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "7"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "**Tailor to Environment**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Scale rigor to project size: lightweight for POCs, strict compliance for "
"production agents, CI/CD, and critical services. Automate compliance "
"where possible."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:46
msgid "The 7 Themes (Continuously Managed)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "Theme"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "What It Means"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "AI Agent Practice"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "**Business Case**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "Why are we doing this?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Tag tasks with value metrics. De-scope low-ROI work. Update business case"
" at each gate with actual vs forecast (cost, velocity, defects). Validate"
" viability ≥ 3 KPIs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "**People** (was Organization, 7th Edition 2023)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "Who does what + team dynamics"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Use role templates. RACI matrix. Team psychology, conflict resolution, "
"psychological safety. Remote/hybrid working considerations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "**Organization**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "[Legacy] Who does what?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Use role templates (Architect, Implementer, Reviewer, QA). RACI matrix "
"for AI vs human decisions. Maintain stakeholder communication matrix."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "**Quality**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "What does \"good\" look like?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Codify quality gates: lint, type-check, test coverage, security scan. "
"Self-validate before submission. Maintain quality register tracking all "
"checks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "**Plans**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "How, when, by whom?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Generate hierarchical task graphs with dependencies, time budgets, "
"milestones. Update based on actual velocity. Decompose product "
"descriptions into tickets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "**Risk**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "What could go wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Pre-scan: dependency conflicts, breaking changes, tech debt. Maintain "
"risk register with probability × impact scoring. Auto-execute mitigations"
" or escalate cumulative exposure > threshold."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "**Change**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "How do we handle deviations?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Formal PR/MR workflows with impact analysis, migration scripts, rollback "
"plans. No scope creep. Require CR link for any scope deviation. CR → "
"commit → release → quality register traceability."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "**Progress**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "Where are we vs. plan?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Track: planned vs actual, test pass rate, code churn, defect density. "
"Alert on tolerance breaches. Generate highlight reports with checkpoint "
"assessments."
msgstr ""

