msgid "1. **Starting Up** (SU)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "Pre-project"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Context initialization. Verify repo access, env configs, ticket "
"alignment. Draft PBS. Set stage tolerances. Create `.prince2/` directory "
"for artifacts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "2. **Initiating** (IP)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "Project setup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Generate initiation doc: architecture brief, quality/risk/change "
"strategies, baseline plan, approval gates. Store in "
"`.prince2/initiation.md`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "3. **Directing** (DP)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "Governance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Submit stage-end reports, exception requests, change proposals. Await "
"authorization before proceeding. Gate: auto-check CI/CD + report "
"generation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "4. **Controlling a Stage** (CS)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "Execution"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Assign work packages. Track progress. Log issues. Monitor tolerances in "
"real-time. Trigger exception workflows on breach. Update quality "
"register."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "5. **Managing Delivery** (MP)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "Core dev loop"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Implement per quality criteria. Run unit/integration tests. Package "
"artifacts. Submit for review. Auto-generate test suites from acceptance "
"criteria (Given/When/Then → Pytest/Jest)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "6. **Stage Boundary** (SB)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "Between phases"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Validate all deliverables. Update business case and risk register. "
"Capture lessons learned. Draft next stage plan for approval. Re-baseline "
"if required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "7. **Closing** (CP)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid "Project end"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md
msgid ""
"Final audit (quality register review, coverage check). Generate "
"documentation. Compile post-project review. Archive learnings to brain. "
"Deactivate ephemeral resources."
msgstr ""

