#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:330
msgid "Benefits Realization Management"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:332
msgid ""
"PRINCE2 requires tracking not just delivery success but **whether the "
"project actually delivers value**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:334
msgid "Benefits Tracking Flow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:339
msgid "Key Practices"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:340
msgid ""
"**Define benefits upfront** — tie each deliverable to measurable outcomes"
" (ROI, user satisfaction, performance improvement)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:341
msgid ""
"**Measure post-delivery** — don't assume benefits are realized just "
"because deliverables shipped"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:342
msgid ""
"**Track leading indicators** — usage metrics, adoption rates, error rates"
" as proxies for benefit realization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:343
msgid ""
"**Close the loop** — feed actual benefits vs forecast back into the "
"Business Case theme"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:344
msgid ""
"**Document in DEBRIEF** — final review includes benefits realization "
"status, not just delivery status"
msgstr ""

