#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:359
msgid "Honcho Memory Integration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:361
msgid ""
"Honcho (honcho.app) provides persistent memory scoped by `app_id`, "
"`user_id`, and `session_id`. When running in multi-context environments "
"(multiple projects, profiles, sessions):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:364
msgid "Scoping Rules"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:365
msgid ""
"Use `app_id` per project — isolates memories to prevent cross-project "
"leakage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:366
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Tag memories with metadata: `{project: \"x\", context: \"planning\", "
"status: \"active\"}`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:367
msgid "Query with semantic search + metadata filter for precise retrieval"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:369
msgid "Memory Lifecycle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:370
msgid ""
"**At project start**: Save mandate, PBS, tolerances as "
"`context:persistent` memories"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:371
msgid ""
"**During execution**: Log exceptions, quality register updates, progress "
"snapshots"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:372
msgid ""
"**At stage boundary**: Archive stage report, update running memory with "
"new baseline"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:373
msgid ""
"**At close**: Final debrief → tagged memory with `status:archived` for "
"future retrieval"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:375
msgid "Conflict Prevention"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:376
msgid ""
"Honcho is append-first — use `memory_id` for explicit updates, never "
"blind overwrites"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:377
msgid "Deduplicate: semantic similarity > 0.85 triggers merge/skip"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/prince2_SKILL.md:378
msgid ""
"Tag cross-session memories with `context:global` for persistence beyond "
"session lifetime"
msgstr ""

